vendor/migan/migan512.onnx: MI-GAN 512 Places2 (Picsart AI Research,
https://github.com/Picsart-AI-Research/MI-GAN, code and weights MIT),
from the TorchScript copy published by IOPaint
(https://github.com/Sanster/models/releases/download/migan/migan_traced.pt,
MD5 76eb3b1a71c400ee3290524f7a11b89c), exported to ONNX (opset 17)
for orOS. Input "input" 1 × 4 × 512 × 512, output "output" 1 × 3 × 512 × 512.
